### Login (Establish Session) to get credentials if needed,
### or rely on browser cookies if using an extension
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### List Designations (with Pagination)
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/designations?limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get Designation by ID
GET{{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/designations/{{designationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create New Designation
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/designations
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "MGR",
    "name": "Manager",
    "level": 3,
    "description": "Manages the team and ensures smooth operations"
}

###

### Update Designation
PATCH{{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/designations/{{designationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "level": 4,
    "description": "Updated duties"
}

###

### Delete Designation
DELETE{{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/designations/{{designationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
